{"id":"n56382-1-8","stage":4,"title":"미사 · 弥撒","scene":"文化与信仰","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n56382-1-8-1","ko":"주말에는 뭘 하고 지냈니?","zh":"周末你都做了些什么？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"주말에는","meaning":"周末","explanation":"주말：周末；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"주말","audio":"/audio/dc80d0fe247835379f4f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"19548","senseId":"1","lemma":"주말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주말에는","audio":"/audio/0b27d6d47879bf3eaa83.mp3"}},{"text":"뭘","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么；ㄹ：을/를 的缩略，标记宾语，如 뭘＝무엇을。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"2","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뭘","audio":"/audio/441ab920d2baa0d1bea5.mp3"}},{"text":"하고","meaning":"表示两个以上的并列或反复。","explanation":"하다：表示两个以上的并列或反复。；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"26","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하고","audio":"/audio/1a7140c02481d065b267.mp3"}},{"text":"지냈니?","meaning":"度过","explanation":"지내다：度过；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"지내다","audio":"/audio/d56e2e0e23cd1763208c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17173","senseId":"4","lemma":"지내다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지냈니","audio":"/audio/9e2928b8baccae422a4d.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"dc80d0fe24783537","term":"주말","zh":"周末","audio":"/audio/dc80d0fe247835379f4f.mp3","entryId":"19548","definition":"一周的尽头。","pronunciation":["주말"]},{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"指代不确定的对象或无需指明名字的对象。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"表示两个以上的并列或反复。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"表示两个以上的并列或反复。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"d56e2e0e23cd1763","term":"지내다","zh":"度过","audio":"/audio/d56e2e0e23cd1763208c.mp3","entryId":"17173","definition":"经过一定的时间。","pronunciation":["지ː내다"]}],"audio":"/audio/9be8388f000c56955f85.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n56382-1-8-2","ko":"토요일에는 영화를 봤고 일요일에는 성당에 가서 미사를 드렸어.","zh":"周六看了电影，周日则去了教堂做弥撒。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"토요일에는","meaning":"星期六，周六，礼拜六","explanation":"토요일：星期六，周六，礼拜六；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"토요일","audio":"/audio/9f4eef79554b65d023ca.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30214","senseId":"1","lemma":"토요일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"토요일에는","audio":"/audio/79792deec6ab25fb17f7.mp3"}},{"text":"영화를","meaning":"电影","explanation":"영화：电影；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"영화","audio":"/audio/1f0a9d32bbf42b6d556f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71624","senseId":"1","lemma":"영화","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"영화를","audio":"/audio/dede45f73452f5a077ee.mp3"}},{"text":"봤고","meaning":"看，观看，观赏","explanation":"보다：看，观看，观赏；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"2","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"봤고","audio":"/audio/032e210364df4b0fb49b.mp3"}},{"text":"일요일에는","meaning":"星期日， 星期天，周日，礼拜天","explanation":"일요일：星期日， 星期天，周日，礼拜天；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"일요일","audio":"/audio/1094b7d96a9a4109f162.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30198","senseId":"1","lemma":"일요일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"일요일에는","audio":"/audio/64239713d5600b64da53.mp3"}},{"text":"성당에","meaning":"教堂，天主堂","explanation":"성당：教堂，天主堂；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"성당","audio":"/audio/d3997782e4484b895c96.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49062","senseId":"1","lemma":"성당","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"성당에","audio":"/audio/cdeadf645170c1e5d762.mp3"}},{"text":"가서","meaning":"去，上","explanation":"가다：去，上；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"6","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가서","audio":"/audio/0a4296790d3f4b0e6e6b.mp3"}},{"text":"미사를","meaning":"弥撒","explanation":"미사：弥撒；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"미사","audio":"/audio/83280abda07a6731cf8a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"56382","senseId":"1","lemma":"미사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"미사를","audio":"/audio/1d330e8747036adcf8ab.mp3"}},{"text":"드렸어.","meaning":"献上，奉上，献给","explanation":"드리다：献上，奉上，献给；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"드리다","audio":"/audio/e583f55bf1cfad46331c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61168","senseId":"3","lemma":"드리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"드렸어","audio":"/audio/3004f2c73776491f9e21.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"9f4eef79554b65d0","term":"토요일","zh":"星期六，周六，礼拜六","audio":"/audio/9f4eef79554b65d023ca.mp3","entryId":"30214","definition":"以星期一为基准，指一个星期中的第六天。","pronunciation":["토요일"]},{"id":"1f0a9d32bbf42b6d","term":"영화","zh":"电影","audio":"/audio/1f0a9d32bbf42b6d556f.mp3","entryId":"71624","definition":"含有一定的意义，拍摄移动的对象，用放映机投影到银幕上看的综合性艺术。","pronunciation":["영화"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看，观看，观赏","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"用眼睛享受或欣赏某个对象。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"1094b7d96a9a4109","term":"일요일","zh":"星期日， 星期天，周日，礼拜天","audio":"/audio/1094b7d96a9a4109f162.mp3","entryId":"30198","definition":"以星期一为基准，指一个星期中的最后一天。","pronunciation":["이료일"]},{"id":"d3997782e4484b89","term":"성당","zh":"教堂，天主堂","audio":"/audio/d3997782e4484b895c96.mp3","entryId":"49062","definition":"进行天主教宗教仪式的建筑。","pronunciation":["성ː당"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去，上","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"为某种目的而向某个地方移动。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"83280abda07a6731","term":"미사","zh":"弥撒","audio":"/audio/83280abda07a6731cf8a.mp3","entryId":"56382","definition":"在天主教堂中进行的宗教仪式。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"e583f55bf1cfad46","term":"드리다","zh":"献上，奉上，献给","audio":"/audio/e583f55bf1cfad46331c.mp3","entryId":"61168","definition":"向神祈祷或敬拜神的仪式。","pronunciation":["드리다"]}],"audio":"/audio/3b2f74aa370efbebfcfe.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.025,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=56382","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":144,"sequenceScore":2.8517,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["周末你都做了些什么？","周六看了电影，周日则去了教堂做弥撒。","进入秋天后，我总是打喷嚏，流鼻涕也很严重。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["周末你都做了些什么？","周六看了电影，周日则去了教堂做弥撒。","进入秋天后，我总是打喷嚏，流鼻涕也很严重。"],"answer":1}]}
